---
const item = "flex items-start gap-[18px] border-b-2 border-dashed border-green py-[22px] last:border-b-0";
const plus = "flex size-11 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-green text-2xl leading-none font-black";
const name = "text-[26px] leading-[1.05] font-black uppercase";
const desc = "mt-2 text-[19px] leading-normal";
---

<section id="whats-inside" class="section-px section-py bg-pink">
  <div class="container-lg grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr))] gap-[clamp(32px,5vw,72px)]">
    <div>
      <h2 class="display-word text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4.25rem)] leading-[0.88] stretch-display">What's inside</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[36ch] text-xl leading-normal">All the good stuff. Five ingredients, one liquid center, zero mystery.</p>
      <button type="button" data-dialog-open="supplement-facts" aria-haspopup="dialog" class="label-caps rounded-card mt-8 flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 border-2 border-dashed border-green bg-white/50 px-6 py-5 text-[17px] text-green">
        Supplement Facts
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl font-black">
          +
        </span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div>
      <ul>
        <li class:list={[item]}>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class:list={[plus]}>
            +
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3 class:list={[name]}>Zinc</h3>
            <p class:list={[desc]} data-copy-review="PENDING (see Notion Regulatory & Compliance §3): EU/US-style nutrient claim is the right shape per Notion, but stays flagged until the final zinc dose is confirmed sufficient to support it">
              An essential mineral. Zinc contributes to normal immune function.*
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class:list={[item]}>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class:list={[plus]}>
            +
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3 class:list={[name]}>Maca</h3>
            <p class:list={[desc]}>Andean root with a big personality.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class:list={[item]}>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class:list={[plus]}>
            +
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3 class:list={[name]}>L-Arginine</h3>
            <p class:list={[desc]}>An amino acid your body already knows.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class:list={[item]}>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class:list={[plus]}>
            +
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3 class:list={[name]}>Pineapple</h3>
            <p class:list={[desc]}>The flavor. A beach holiday in your mouth.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class:list={[item]}>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class:list={[plus]}>
            +
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3 class:list={[name]}>Liquid center</h3>
            <p class:list={[desc]}>Because a solid chew is just candy.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-[1.6] opacity-90" data-copy-review="PENDING: this '1 to 3 a day' wording matches Notion Regulatory & Compliance §3 and Produkt & Rezeptur — it is the Supplement Facts panel (generic placeholder, 'one gummy a day' / 93 servings) that needs to be rebuilt per-product, not this line">
        Serving: 1 chew. Take 1 to 3 a day. Please don't exceed the recommended amount, more isn't better, it's just more.
        <button type="button" data-dialog-open="supplement-facts" aria-haspopup="dialog" class="cursor-pointer underline">
          See Supplement Facts
        </button>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-[1.6] opacity-90">
        We can't promise the perfect gumshot. But we nailed the flavor.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
